{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a04336a5-5584-8b90-a452-9a53d74a8212",
  "created_at": "2025-12-18T16:16:54-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Anh Rahman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T16:15:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T16:15:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. My name is Anh Rahman. I am calling about a drain on the street, at 156 Ocean Avenue, the Ocean Drive side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T16:15:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 156 Ocean Avenue. What's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T16:15:41-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The grate at the curb, it has sunk down. With this rain, the water goes everywhere but down the drain. It runs past it, into the road, very big puddle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T16:15:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that soaker's been a mess. Did it just wrap up there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T16:15:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it came Wednesday and finished today. I am looking out the window all morning. I am a night nurse's aide, so I have not slept yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T16:16:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, you've been up all night. Thanks for calling it in. Anything else about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T16:16:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Also there is a manhole cover near there. It looks off by one inch, maybe. Not sitting even with the road. I think a car can hit it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T16:16:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, I'll put both in the same report, the sunken grate and the cover that's sitting uneven. Can I get a number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T16:16:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is 401-555-0180."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T16:16:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0180. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T16:16:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please, can somebody call me back when it is done? Then I know it is fixed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T16:16:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll note that on the order. We'll call you when the crew's finished."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T16:16:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. Now I go to sleep, finally."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T16:16:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You do that. Take care, Mr. Rahman."
    }
  ],
